## ✅ Smell-Free Pattern (Good Example)

**Test:** `ValidateOrder_NullOrder_ThrowsArgumentNullException` (line 155) — uses `Assert.ThrowsException<T>`, asserts on a specific property, no magic numbers, no external dependencies. This is the model to follow.

