## Prioritized Remediation Plan

| Priority | Smell | Effort | Rationale |
|----------|-------|--------|-----------|
| 1 | Assertion-Free Test | 5 min | False-pass risk — test proves nothing today |
| 2 | Conditional Test Logic | 10 min | Hidden gap — one branch is never verified |
| 3 | Sleepy Test | 15 min | Flakiness source + slows CI by 2 s per run |
| 4 | Mystery Guest | 10 min | Blocks CI portability entirely |
| 5 | Exception Handling | 5 min | Quick swap to `Assert.ThrowsException` |
| 6 | Magic Number + Roulette | 10 min | Fix together (same test method) |
| 7 | Eager Test | 20 min | Requires decomposition into focused tests |
| 8 | Sensitive Equality | 10 min | Requires exposing structured properties |
| 9 | General Fixture | 2 min | Delete one unused field |

